<title>USA: Craftmade restates FY96 to $0.56 EPS.</title>
<headline>Craftmade restates FY96 to $0.56 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>COPPELL, Texas 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Craftmade International Inc on Wednesday said fiscal 1996 year-end earnings were $0.56 per share, versus the previously reported unaudited figure of $0.58.</p>
<p>The company said the corrected figure for the year ending June 30 was the result of an income tax adjustment.</p>
</text>
